{"speciesId":253,"names":{"fr":"Massko","es":"Grovyle","en":"Grovyle","ja":"ジュプトル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The leaves growing out of GROVYLE’s body are convenient for camouflaging it from enemies in the forest. This POKéMON is a master at climbing trees in jungles."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"This POKéMON adeptly flies from branch to branch in trees. In a forest, no POKéMON can ever hope to catch a fleeing GROVYLE however fast they may be."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Leaves grow out of this POKéMON’s body. They help obscure a GROVYLE from the eyes of its enemies while it is in a thickly overgrown forest."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its strongly developed thigh muscles give it astounding agility and jumping performance."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its strongly developed thigh muscles give it astounding agility and jumping performance."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It leaps from tree branch to tree branch quite swiftly. It shows astounding agility."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It leaps from tree branch to tree branch quite swiftly. It shows astounding agility."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vit dans les jungles denses. Il saute de branche en branche pour approcher de sa proie."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vit dans les jungles denses. Il saute de branche en branche pour approcher de sa proie."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les muscles surdéveloppés de ses cuisses permettent à Massko de sauter incroyablement haut."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los desarrollados músculos que tiene en las extremidades inferiores le hacen ser muy ágil y le permiten dar grandes saltos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its strongly developed thigh muscles give it astounding agility and jumping performance."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"発達した 太ももの 筋肉が 驚異的な 瞬発力と 跳躍力を 生み出すぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit dans les jungles denses. Il saute de branche en branche pour approcher de sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en selvas frondosas. Salta de rama en rama para acercarse a sus presas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"密林に 生息する。 枝から 枝へ 飛び移りながら 移動して 獲物に 接近する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les feuilles qui poussent sur le corps de Massko sont bien pratiques lorsqu’il veut se camoufler dans la forêt. Ce Pokémon est passé maître dans l’art de grimper aux arbres."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Las hojas que Grovyle tiene por el cuerpo le resultan muy útiles para camuflarse en el bosque y esconderse de los enemigos. A este Pokémon no hay quien lo supere subiendo a los árboles del bosque."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The leaves growing out of Grovyle’s body are convenient for camouflaging it from enemies in the forest. This Pokémon is a master at climbing trees in jungles."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体から 生えた 葉っぱは 森の 中で 敵から 姿を 隠す ときに 便利。 密林に 暮らす 木登りの 名手。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon vole de branche en branche avec brio. En forêt, aucun Pokémon, même le plus rapide, ne peut espérer attraper un Massko qui s’enfuit."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Este Pokémon revolotea de rama en rama con maestría. Cuando Grovyle va volando por el bosque, no hay quien lo alcance por muy rápido que sea."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This Pokémon adeptly flies from branch to branch in trees. In a forest, no Pokémon can ever hope to catch a fleeing Grovyle however fast they may be."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"枝から 枝へ 身軽に 飛び回る。 どんなに 素早い ポケモンも 森の 中で ジュプトルを 捕まえる ことは 不可能だ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":253,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[2